WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:37.690 --> 01:42.940
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.660 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 6]

02:03.950 --> 02:05.040
You want revenge.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.680
Do you think those few
martial wanderers alone

02:07.680 --> 02:08.800
can help you?

02:09.520 --> 02:11.520
In this grave called the Xie family,

02:11.590 --> 02:13.650
the living suffer more than the dead.

02:14.080 --> 02:15.000
I'm the only one

02:15.680 --> 02:16.680
who can help you.

02:18.960 --> 02:21.150
Is Your Lordship willing to help me?

02:22.710 --> 02:23.470
I used to just

02:24.120 --> 02:25.560
want you to be obedient,

02:26.030 --> 02:28.630
but I realized you're not one
to submit easily.

02:28.870 --> 02:29.910
So I figured

02:30.030 --> 02:31.630
I should change my strategy.

02:35.430 --> 02:36.760
Let's form an alliance.

02:38.010 --> 02:43.360
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

02:38.240 --> 02:39.570
Through thick and thin.

02:43.430 --> 02:47.840
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

02:44.680 --> 02:46.150
I mean, to protect and support each other.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.120
Are you in?

02:47.870 --> 02:51.960
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

02:51.980 --> 02:56.690
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

02:56.710 --> 03:01.330
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

03:00.400 --> 03:01.520
I have plenty of patience.

03:01.350 --> 03:05.400
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

03:02.120 --> 03:03.400
You will figure it out.

03:05.420 --> 03:10.000
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

03:10.020 --> 03:15.970
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

03:35.030 --> 03:35.680
Mother.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.750
Since you returned to the residence,

03:41.750 --> 03:44.310
we haven't talked much.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.840
You call me Mother,

03:47.030 --> 03:49.290
but I've not fulfilled my motherly duty,

03:49.430 --> 03:50.800
failing to protect you.

03:52.310 --> 03:53.400
I'm so ashamed.

03:56.000 --> 03:56.960
Old Madam

03:57.190 --> 03:59.120
wanted to have a good talk with you

03:59.430 --> 04:01.030
after you returned.

04:01.470 --> 04:04.280
But she's getting on in years

04:04.840 --> 04:07.430
and hasn't been feeling well lately,

04:07.750 --> 04:10.520
so she asked me to talk to you.

04:12.000 --> 04:12.910
That night,

04:12.910 --> 04:14.170
when you were injured,

04:14.910 --> 04:16.310
she was

04:17.360 --> 04:18.750
deeply distressed.

04:22.720 --> 04:24.950
I'm taking her away to protect her.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.630
Any objections?

04:29.600 --> 04:30.860
If she was distressed,

04:31.190 --> 04:33.240
why did she give me to Lord Yan?

04:40.510 --> 04:42.480
You've been away for long,

04:43.430 --> 04:46.600
so naturally, you don't know
the rules of the inner quarters.

04:46.600 --> 04:49.930
With Concubine Mei now calling the shots
both inside and out

04:49.950 --> 04:52.430
and Nanny Rong emboldened by her backing,

04:53.070 --> 04:56.000
do you realize the predicament
Old Madam is in?

04:56.720 --> 04:58.070
In all matters,

04:58.360 --> 04:59.690
when the master speaks,

04:59.920 --> 05:03.270
servants shouldn't question it.

05:03.480 --> 05:06.830
When the husband speaks,
the wife shouldn't question it.

05:07.070 --> 05:08.600
When the elders speak,

05:09.360 --> 05:14.070
juniors shouldn't question it.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.830
Do you understand?

05:18.510 --> 05:19.310
Yes.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.870
I will keep in mind

05:21.160 --> 05:22.240
what you just said.

05:27.360 --> 05:28.760
I had this wound medicine

05:28.870 --> 05:30.390
specially prepared

05:30.390 --> 05:31.600
for you.

05:32.150 --> 05:34.560
Apply it for Fourth Lady
after you go back.

05:35.120 --> 05:35.600
Yes.

05:36.430 --> 05:37.360
Also,

05:37.390 --> 05:38.310
Old Madam

05:38.310 --> 05:40.480
fined Nanny Rong three months' wages.

05:41.270 --> 05:42.270
That should

05:43.870 --> 05:45.720
right some wrongs for you.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.680
So my body full of wounds

05:49.310 --> 05:51.240
and nearly losing my life
amount to

05:51.750 --> 05:54.350
nothing more than
3 months of someone's wages.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.010
Thank you, Mother.

05:58.310 --> 05:59.630
I'll take my leave now

05:59.950 --> 06:01.560
so as not to disturb your rest.

06:01.560 --> 06:02.270
Qingyuan.

06:03.720 --> 06:04.950
These days,

06:05.750 --> 06:08.000
rumors about you and Lord Yan

06:08.680 --> 06:09.870
are everywhere.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.270
Old Madam wants you to

06:12.720 --> 06:14.560
stay in the residence

06:14.720 --> 06:17.120
and not go out until the rumors die down,

06:17.950 --> 06:21.390
to avoid further gossip.

06:23.390 --> 06:24.120
Noted.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.600
That girl...

06:34.430 --> 06:35.630
It's a shame

06:36.240 --> 06:38.159
she looks too much like you.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.040
Go ahead and speak.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.360
Second Madam,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.360
if only you saw it.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.040
In broad daylight,

06:48.040 --> 06:49.480
that girl was

06:49.480 --> 06:50.510
with that man Yan,

06:50.750 --> 06:52.240
tugging at each other

06:52.240 --> 06:53.190
and flirting.

06:53.190 --> 06:54.480
Talk about shameless!

06:54.870 --> 06:57.800
As they say,
the apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.750
A crooked stick will
always have a crooked shadow.

07:00.750 --> 07:02.630
The rich and powerful in Hengtang

07:03.070 --> 07:05.920
all want to cling to
that corrupt official for protection.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.920
Keeping Qingyuan in our residence

07:08.360 --> 07:09.720
has its uses.

07:14.870 --> 07:15.830
Second Madam,

07:15.830 --> 07:17.360
what brilliant foresight!

07:17.360 --> 07:18.310
You're so wise.

07:18.600 --> 07:20.360
No wonder you're in charge.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.500
Through and through,

07:21.500 --> 07:23.510
the Xie family still has to rely on you.

07:23.510 --> 07:24.800
Is that a new bracelet?

07:27.270 --> 07:28.680
Looks quite heavy.

07:30.310 --> 07:31.430
You have a good eye.

07:32.000 --> 07:34.070
It's just coated with gold dust,

07:34.070 --> 07:34.950
not worth much.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.310
You manage the Xie Estate.

07:40.510 --> 07:42.120
So many eyes are on you.

07:42.720 --> 07:44.120
At your age,

07:44.360 --> 07:46.000
I shouldn't have to teach you

07:46.000 --> 07:47.720
not to flaunt your wealth.

07:48.750 --> 07:50.380
Are you dying for others to see

07:50.380 --> 07:51.840
your little illicit gain?

07:52.720 --> 07:53.520
Second Madam,

07:53.600 --> 07:55.130
I have no other intentions.

07:55.240 --> 07:56.360
I just want to

07:56.360 --> 07:57.950
handle things well for you.

08:00.160 --> 08:00.800
Alright.

08:02.950 --> 08:04.310
I'm not blaming you.

08:04.430 --> 08:06.190
If I don't feed my underlings well,

08:06.190 --> 08:07.310
that little silver

08:07.750 --> 08:09.610
won't come into my pocket either.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.950
In my eyes,

08:14.950 --> 08:16.230
this thing of yours

08:16.230 --> 08:17.750
isn't really a big deal.

08:20.310 --> 08:23.270
I just hope it doesn't set off suspicion

08:23.390 --> 08:26.720
and lead people to discover
the dealings behind the estate.

08:27.430 --> 08:29.800
The consequences will be too heavy to bear

08:30.310 --> 08:32.110
even with the two of us combined.

08:34.909 --> 08:36.370
You're absolutely right.

08:36.840 --> 08:39.169
I'm aware of the gravity of the situation.

08:42.740 --> 08:45.900
[Danyue Pavilion]

08:48.720 --> 08:49.510
My Lady,

08:49.670 --> 08:51.080
you really hit the nail on the head.

08:51.080 --> 08:52.000
I probed into it.

08:52.000 --> 08:52.960
Nanny Rong is

08:52.960 --> 08:55.150
indeed a dog serving multiple masters.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.690
Every night after she gets off work,

08:56.690 --> 08:58.960
she goes to Liuhua Courtyard
to tip them off.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.630
She and Mei Yinghua must be

09:00.630 --> 09:03.030
up to something shady in the estate.

09:03.750 --> 09:05.270
No one wakes up early for no reason.

09:05.270 --> 09:07.030
Overseeing such a lucrative estate,
they must have

09:07.030 --> 09:08.670
skimmed a hefty profit for themselves.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.750
Exactly.

09:09.750 --> 09:11.550
She bought a gold bracelet days ago,

09:11.550 --> 09:13.000
and couldn't stop showing it off.

09:13.000 --> 09:16.860
I wonder how much hard-earned money
she's extorted from the tenants.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.720
With Mei Yinghua backing her

09:19.720 --> 09:22.150
and Old Madam giving her free rein,

09:22.630 --> 09:24.290
it's no wonder a nanny like her

09:24.480 --> 09:26.280
is lawless in the Xie household.

09:26.510 --> 09:28.150
She goes around bullying the weak,

09:28.150 --> 09:29.260
shortchanges the tenant farmers,

09:29.260 --> 09:30.990
and runs amok in the residence.

09:33.000 --> 09:34.270
To bring her down,

09:35.080 --> 09:36.940
you have to dismantle her backing

09:37.000 --> 09:39.000
and leave her completely on her own.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.460
You're right, My Lady.

09:41.790 --> 09:42.440
Baoxian.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.960
Do something for me.

09:48.790 --> 09:51.320
Greetings, Lord Yan!

09:52.040 --> 09:52.790
Well,

09:53.080 --> 09:54.080
Lord Yan,

09:54.390 --> 09:56.750
we're all busy with governmental affairs.

09:56.750 --> 09:58.120
May I ask what this meeting

09:58.120 --> 09:59.030
is about?

09:59.630 --> 10:01.440
Well, i-it's not really the time

10:01.440 --> 10:03.270
to be painting the town red.

10:04.790 --> 10:05.870
I was afraid

10:05.870 --> 10:08.240
that you lords are too busy,

10:08.440 --> 10:11.510
so I invited you to revisit this place.

10:12.030 --> 10:14.090
Perhaps you might recall something.

10:14.630 --> 10:17.480
The murderer who assassinated
the Xie Estate manager

10:17.480 --> 10:20.540
also came here to drink with courtesans
before he died.

10:20.960 --> 10:22.320
I wonder

10:22.720 --> 10:24.550
who he came here with that night.

10:26.120 --> 10:26.950
Was it you?

10:28.270 --> 10:29.120
No, no.

10:29.270 --> 10:30.390
It wasn't me.

10:31.630 --> 10:32.600
Or you?

10:32.600 --> 10:34.200
N-No, My Lord.

10:34.200 --> 10:35.800
I truly have no clue about it.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.090
That shouldn't be.

10:39.240 --> 10:41.360
Only a handful of
Zuixian Tavern flower tokens

10:41.360 --> 10:43.150
exist in all of Hengtang.

10:43.480 --> 10:45.480
How did it end up on the murderer?

10:49.030 --> 10:51.200
Lord Guo, I remember you have one.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.270
Take it out and let us see.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.120
Lord Yan,

10:53.670 --> 10:54.730
you must be joking.

10:54.750 --> 10:57.240
How could I have such a token?

11:01.270 --> 11:01.960
Right.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.720
I was just joking.

11:07.720 --> 11:09.270
Why's everyone so nervous?

11:12.030 --> 11:13.000
Sit, sit.

11:13.550 --> 11:16.000
-Come on. Please.
-Lord Guo, please.

11:16.000 --> 11:17.200
-Sit, sit.
-Sure.

11:18.000 --> 11:19.240
However,

11:19.550 --> 11:22.680
it seems the estate manager
lost a ledger before he died.

11:24.720 --> 11:26.120
Lord Guo, do you think

11:26.600 --> 11:29.630
the ledger was hidden by the killer,

11:29.630 --> 11:30.600
or

11:30.750 --> 11:32.610
did it really fall into the river?

11:33.240 --> 11:34.120
Lord Yan,

11:34.600 --> 11:37.720
how... would I know?

11:38.240 --> 11:40.550
Perhaps it really fell into the river.

11:40.840 --> 11:41.610
Fell into the river.

11:41.610 --> 11:42.600
It fell into the river.

11:42.600 --> 11:43.600
Right, right.

11:46.550 --> 11:48.240
Speaking of the ledger,

11:48.240 --> 11:50.600
I've heard a story.

11:51.030 --> 11:52.600
In a certain estate,

11:52.600 --> 11:55.750
the dividends meant for the tenant farmers

11:55.750 --> 11:57.280
were repeatedly deducted.

11:57.440 --> 11:59.440
This left the tenants with no choice

11:59.600 --> 12:01.510
but to borrow money from the government.

12:01.510 --> 12:03.240
Money is easy to borrow

12:03.630 --> 12:04.720
but hard to repay.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.870
The compound interest accumulates quickly.

12:06.870 --> 12:07.840
So the people

12:07.840 --> 12:10.500
could only use their food at home
as collateral.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.360
As time passed,

12:11.360 --> 12:12.360
the food ran out,

12:12.360 --> 12:14.290
and they couldn't repay the money.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.790
Take a guess, Your Lordships.

12:15.790 --> 12:17.390
Where did the money

12:17.510 --> 12:18.910
they borrowed come from?

12:24.360 --> 12:25.200
I have no clue.

12:26.670 --> 12:28.440
-Me neither.
-Me neither.

12:31.510 --> 12:33.200
I think the real kicker

12:33.270 --> 12:34.630
of this story is that

12:36.320 --> 12:38.030
the borrowed money is exactly

12:38.030 --> 12:40.550
the money taken from the tenants' pockets

12:40.550 --> 12:41.670
in the first place.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.910
Interesting, isn't it?

12:47.910 --> 12:48.860
Yes, yes!

12:48.910 --> 12:51.240
Yes! S-So very interesting.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.730
Interesting.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.550
They say the ledger fell into the river.

12:56.550 --> 12:57.550
Do you believe it?

12:58.150 --> 12:59.610
I don't believe it anyway.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.630
Neither do I.

13:00.670 --> 13:01.670
But Your Lordship,

13:01.670 --> 13:03.150
the ledger hasn't been found yet.

13:03.150 --> 13:04.270
Won't doing this

13:04.440 --> 13:05.550
alert the enemy?

13:06.120 --> 13:07.360
That's exactly why

13:08.030 --> 13:09.750
we have to alert the enemy.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.320
Keep a close eye on them these few days.

13:12.320 --> 13:14.200
They'll definitely lose their composure

13:14.200 --> 13:16.270
and reveal something useful to us.

13:16.630 --> 13:17.290
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.200
Has Fourth Lady been here recently?

13:21.440 --> 13:22.570
No word from her yet.

13:32.690 --> 13:35.100
[Chuxiang Pavilion]

13:33.550 --> 13:34.750
-Guo.
-Second Young Master!

13:34.750 --> 13:35.320
Come, come.

13:35.320 --> 13:37.200
Why did you start drinking by yourself?

13:37.200 --> 13:38.240
Come on, join me.

13:38.240 --> 13:40.700
Why didn't you get a lady
to sing a tune or two?

13:42.550 --> 13:43.480
Let's drink.

13:47.720 --> 13:48.390
Guo,

13:48.720 --> 13:49.440
what's wrong?

13:49.440 --> 13:51.500
Seems like you have a lot on your mind.

13:51.870 --> 13:54.200
Did something go wrong with our business?

13:54.630 --> 13:55.480
It's fine.

14:00.750 --> 14:01.950
Second Young Master.

14:02.440 --> 14:03.270
I heard that

14:03.270 --> 14:04.630
Lord Yan has been getting

14:04.630 --> 14:06.560
quite close to your family of late.

14:07.000 --> 14:09.630
Have you heard anything about it?

14:10.910 --> 14:12.510
Of course I have!

14:12.790 --> 14:14.080
You know what?

14:14.480 --> 14:17.150
Lord Yan's taken a fancy
to my fourth sister.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.960
They're really a match made in heaven.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.080
-A handsome couple.
-Yeah, okay.

14:20.080 --> 14:21.030
A perfect match.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.480
What I really want to ask is

14:23.480 --> 14:24.440
about the treasure

14:24.440 --> 14:26.270
I asked you to keep for me before.

14:26.600 --> 14:28.260
Have you been keeping it safe?

14:29.790 --> 14:30.550
Treasure?

14:31.000 --> 14:31.860
What treasure?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.440
Oh, you mean those picture books.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.320
Yes, yes.

14:39.600 --> 14:41.750
I'm really sorry about them.

14:41.910 --> 14:44.310
My mother found them and confiscated them.

14:44.440 --> 14:44.960
Confiscated?

14:44.960 --> 14:47.890
-I didn't know how to tell you—
-W-What about the box?

14:47.910 --> 14:49.030
What box?

14:49.150 --> 14:51.320
The wooden box that held the books.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.390
There's an ink seal of

14:52.390 --> 14:53.720
Jinsu Pastry Shop on it.

14:53.870 --> 14:55.070
Did she take that too?

14:59.840 --> 15:00.270
Second Young Master,

15:00.270 --> 15:01.750
didn't I tell you

15:01.750 --> 15:03.360
to keep it safe for me

15:03.360 --> 15:05.150
and not to give it to anyone else?

15:05.150 --> 15:07.240
-But my mother isn't just anyone else.
-You...

15:07.240 --> 15:08.630
What's wrong, Guo?

15:08.630 --> 15:09.630
Why so nervous?

15:09.840 --> 15:11.270
Is that box so valuable?

15:16.440 --> 15:18.390
Relax.

15:18.750 --> 15:19.390
How about this?

15:19.390 --> 15:20.000
When I go back,

15:20.000 --> 15:21.200
I'll ask her about it.

15:21.910 --> 15:23.240
You must ask her. Please.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.200
You have to.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.910
Come. Let's drink.

15:30.320 --> 15:31.200
Mother!

15:31.510 --> 15:32.150
Mother,

15:32.150 --> 15:33.870
where did I put my wooden box?

15:34.360 --> 15:34.870
Mothe—

15:36.510 --> 15:37.630
Mother, you're here.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.720
My wooden box...

15:42.790 --> 15:43.650
Oh! There it is—

15:44.510 --> 15:44.960
W-What is it?

15:44.960 --> 15:47.320
Are you really dumb or just pretending?

15:47.550 --> 15:48.910
Don't you know what's in it?

15:48.910 --> 15:49.710
What's wrong?

15:50.200 --> 15:51.870
It's just a few books of eroti...

15:51.870 --> 15:53.030
erotic art.

15:54.910 --> 15:57.330
Underneath those books of yours is

15:57.360 --> 16:00.020
the ledger for
the illicit sale of relief grain.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.750
W-What?

16:03.910 --> 16:05.000
Why didn't I know?

16:06.750 --> 16:08.630
No wonder Guo Baofeng was so nervous.

16:08.630 --> 16:10.200
So he passed the hot potato

16:10.200 --> 16:11.200
to me!

16:11.960 --> 16:14.670
You can't even manage a small estate well.

16:15.270 --> 16:16.480
If this thing

16:16.510 --> 16:17.870
falls into Yan Rui's hands,

16:17.870 --> 16:18.960
when implicated,

16:18.960 --> 16:20.390
you'll be beheaded!

16:23.000 --> 16:23.600
Mother,

16:23.840 --> 16:25.550
I'll go beg Lord Wei now.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.200
You...

16:26.910 --> 16:29.110
Why'd you deliver yourself to his door?

16:29.150 --> 16:30.630
Wei Changyan would love nothing more

16:30.630 --> 16:32.290
than for you to die for him now.

16:33.550 --> 16:34.610
Listen carefully.

16:34.750 --> 16:36.150
You can't let anyone know

16:36.150 --> 16:37.950
that this ledger is in our hands.

16:38.790 --> 16:39.360
Also,

16:40.360 --> 16:41.790
if Guo Baofeng asks,

16:43.080 --> 16:43.910
just say

16:43.910 --> 16:45.000
I burned it.

16:46.270 --> 16:46.960
Okay.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.720
Yes, I got it.

16:50.150 --> 16:51.320
Second Madam!

16:53.440 --> 16:54.840
-Second Madam!
-You may leave.

16:54.840 --> 16:55.360
Okay.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.440
-Second Madam.
-Goodness.

17:02.440 --> 17:03.480
What's the panic?

17:04.160 --> 17:04.960
Second Madam,

17:05.109 --> 17:06.160
our estate is

17:06.920 --> 17:07.920
in big trouble!

17:07.920 --> 17:09.319
What could've happened?

17:09.750 --> 17:12.680
Didn't we withhold the tenants' wages?

17:12.680 --> 17:14.510
They heard about our usury business.

17:14.510 --> 17:15.480
Having nowhere else

17:15.480 --> 17:17.069
to turn for their money,

17:17.069 --> 17:19.000
they're now inciting people to riot!

17:19.000 --> 17:20.640
A disaster also hit us this year,

17:20.640 --> 17:22.790
and all the money lent out
can't be recovered.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.050
With all this going on,

17:24.200 --> 17:25.010
things are

17:25.310 --> 17:26.880
going to get real messy.

17:28.790 --> 17:31.240
Everything and everyone is a headache.

17:32.510 --> 17:33.840
Where did those tenants

17:33.960 --> 17:35.830
get such reliable news?

17:37.160 --> 17:38.400
Could someone be

17:38.920 --> 17:41.120
leaking information behind our backs?

17:41.200 --> 17:42.930
I'm also wondering about this.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.360
It wasn't me, Second Madam.

17:48.030 --> 17:50.480
I absolutely did not leak a single word.

17:55.200 --> 17:56.000
Second Madam.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.510
About us moving the money,

17:59.790 --> 18:02.240
only you and I know.

18:04.110 --> 18:05.200
If it wasn't you,

18:06.000 --> 18:07.460
could it have been me?

18:08.240 --> 18:09.480
I'm innocent.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.920
You know that

18:11.680 --> 18:13.000
I guard our estate

18:13.240 --> 18:15.110
like my own life.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.640
Why'd I leak it?

18:16.790 --> 18:19.240
I value my life and this prosperity

18:19.240 --> 18:20.240
too much for that.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.350
Right?

18:26.270 --> 18:27.070
Alright.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.250
I'll figure something out.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.240
You may leave.

18:44.790 --> 18:46.480
She's losing her marbles.

18:46.880 --> 18:48.140
Keep a close eye on her.

18:48.830 --> 18:49.960
Don't let her handle

18:50.960 --> 18:52.240
anything important.

18:53.070 --> 18:53.870
Second Madam,

18:54.070 --> 18:57.000
if this gets out,
we can't keep it under wraps for long.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.480
We need to plan ahead.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.240
Here, Qingyuan.

19:05.350 --> 19:06.750
Thank you, Second Madam.

19:07.240 --> 19:09.000
What's the occasion today?

19:09.550 --> 19:10.880
You actually thought of

19:11.200 --> 19:12.960
inviting Qingyuan for a meal.

19:13.510 --> 19:14.510
Old Madam,

19:14.830 --> 19:17.750
Nanny Rong and I are
getting up there in years.

19:18.110 --> 19:20.640
I fear we may no longer have the stamina
to oversee the estate

19:20.640 --> 19:22.000
day in and day out.

19:22.240 --> 19:23.720
If we don't visit,

19:23.720 --> 19:25.790
we can't keep the subordinates in check.

19:25.790 --> 19:28.440
So after thinking it over,

19:29.070 --> 19:32.270
I thought it'd be better to find someone
from the younger generation

19:32.270 --> 19:33.720
to help me out.

19:39.110 --> 19:41.440
It's so kind of you
to care about this old servant.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.920
With these old bones of mine,

19:42.920 --> 19:44.050
I'm used to working.

19:44.160 --> 19:45.360
If I had nothing to do,

19:45.400 --> 19:47.530
I wouldn't know what to do with myself.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.070
Qingyuan,

19:54.400 --> 19:57.510
you've suffered so much outside
all these years.

19:57.790 --> 19:59.920
Now that you're back in the Xie family,

20:00.110 --> 20:02.790
I must make sure
you're treated with the utmost care.

20:02.790 --> 20:05.240
But you have a strong personality.

20:05.590 --> 20:08.680
You're certainly not one to accept

20:08.920 --> 20:10.480
gifts of gold and jewels.

20:10.750 --> 20:13.070
So I thought I should

20:13.790 --> 20:15.720
hand the estate over

20:15.960 --> 20:17.830
to Qingyuan to manage.

20:22.110 --> 20:22.960
Second Madam.

20:23.400 --> 20:25.590
Do you think I'm cut out for business?

20:25.830 --> 20:27.290
Besides, isn't the estate

20:27.400 --> 20:29.440
usually managed by Second Brother?

20:29.680 --> 20:31.110
If I take it over so abruptly,

20:31.110 --> 20:32.640
it might be inappropriate.

20:33.510 --> 20:35.350
What's inappropriate about it?

20:35.480 --> 20:37.920
Your second brother caused such a big mess

20:37.920 --> 20:39.590
at the government office.

20:39.750 --> 20:41.350
He can't even take care of himself.

20:41.350 --> 20:43.880
How could I leave the estate to him?

20:44.310 --> 20:46.550
You have the skills and the guts.

20:46.720 --> 20:49.350
I'll feel at ease
leaving the estate to you.

20:53.830 --> 20:55.960
Old Madam, what do you think?

21:00.510 --> 21:02.480
Handing over the estate
is no small matter.

21:02.480 --> 21:04.310
Why rush, Second Madam?

21:04.750 --> 21:06.880
Why not wait for the patriarch to return?

21:06.880 --> 21:08.940
It won't be too late to let him decide.

21:09.000 --> 21:11.240
The patriarch has
so many things to deal with.

21:11.240 --> 21:13.920
No need to bother him
with such a small household matter.

21:13.920 --> 21:16.550
But Fourth Lady is
of noble and precious birth.

21:16.720 --> 21:19.550
She probably can't even
tell wheatgrass from chives.

21:19.550 --> 21:21.680
Old Madam, I'm just a foolish servant.

21:21.750 --> 21:24.160
But even in the hardest of times,
the estate's never

21:24.160 --> 21:26.160
let the household go hungry, has it?

21:29.070 --> 21:31.110
Nanny Rong, you're right to criticize me.

21:31.110 --> 21:32.750
I'm not as capable as you.

21:33.750 --> 21:36.550
But I don't know where I heard that

21:36.880 --> 21:39.520
the estate spends
hundreds of taels of silver yearly

21:39.520 --> 21:41.480
to build some canal.

21:41.830 --> 21:43.030
Yet, for some reason,

21:43.200 --> 21:44.550
the tenant farmers there

21:44.550 --> 21:46.270
can't even dig a well.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.310
I wonder where that canal

21:52.240 --> 21:53.480
leads to.

21:54.110 --> 21:54.960
What canal?

21:55.270 --> 21:56.530
There's no such thing.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.430
On the contrary,

21:58.590 --> 22:00.390
why is my bracelet on your wrist?

22:01.590 --> 22:02.650
First Madam, look.

22:04.160 --> 22:05.420
Where's the bracelet?

22:06.110 --> 22:07.240
Preposterous!

22:07.240 --> 22:07.830
First Madam,

22:07.830 --> 22:08.640
my bracelet...

22:08.640 --> 22:09.200
I...

22:10.000 --> 22:11.240
What bracelet?

22:11.550 --> 22:12.440
On my arm,

22:13.480 --> 22:15.680
there are only scars left by you, Nanny.

22:16.030 --> 22:17.700
It hurts to have my scars

22:18.030 --> 22:19.790
on display for everyone.

22:19.880 --> 22:21.080
It's so humiliating.

22:29.310 --> 22:31.200
What a loyal servant you are.

22:31.440 --> 22:33.400
It's not enough that
you took the law into your own hands

22:33.400 --> 22:35.160
and harmed Qingyuan before.

22:35.310 --> 22:37.350
Now you dare to be even more insolent

22:37.350 --> 22:39.070
right in my presence!

22:39.480 --> 22:42.280
Misappropriating funds
and abusing your master!

22:43.200 --> 22:44.720
Confiscate her badge!

22:47.000 --> 22:48.000
The estate will be

22:48.640 --> 22:50.110
handed over to Qingyuan.

22:52.720 --> 22:54.310
She's our own flesh and blood.

22:54.310 --> 22:56.790
No outsider gets to mistreat her.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.880
And you.

23:00.200 --> 23:02.310
Bring such filth near me again,

23:02.310 --> 23:03.570
and you'll be stripped

23:03.720 --> 23:05.180
of your management rights

23:05.240 --> 23:07.160
over this household.

23:12.590 --> 23:13.990
Old Madam, you're right.

23:14.550 --> 23:15.640
You old servant,

23:15.790 --> 23:17.480
how dare you bully Qingyuan?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.550
See how I deal with you.

23:18.550 --> 23:19.880
Chuntai, beat her hard!

23:27.000 --> 23:28.680
I've lost my appetite.

23:30.960 --> 23:31.790
Careful.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.920
Old Madam!

23:52.550 --> 23:53.880
I clearly saw

23:54.350 --> 23:55.680
my bracelet on your arm.

23:57.070 --> 23:59.160
Is this what you're talking about?

24:04.480 --> 24:05.810
You did do it on purpose.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.010
Come with me

24:07.400 --> 24:08.790
to report to Old Madam.

24:09.110 --> 24:10.400
Let's settle this head-on.

24:10.400 --> 24:12.330
Nanny, you must be getting senile.

24:12.880 --> 24:14.480
So what if I did it on purpose?

24:15.000 --> 24:17.460
I'm Old Madam's biological granddaughter.

24:17.750 --> 24:18.950
Settle this head-on?

24:19.070 --> 24:21.440
Do you think
she'll side with a servant like you?

24:21.440 --> 24:22.970
You deliberately set me up.

24:23.480 --> 24:24.880
I've endured for decades

24:25.030 --> 24:26.400
in the Xie Residence.

24:26.830 --> 24:28.550
You, a bastard who came out of nowhere,

24:28.550 --> 24:30.810
have no right to steal the estate from me!

24:40.000 --> 24:40.790
Bastard?

24:42.640 --> 24:44.680
What a familiar title.

24:45.240 --> 24:46.640
Nineteen years ago,

24:47.830 --> 24:50.000
when you beat my mother black and blue

24:50.680 --> 24:52.310
and she begged you for mercy,

24:53.030 --> 24:54.830
you called her that too.

24:55.830 --> 24:57.830
My mother never hurt anyone.

24:58.480 --> 25:00.410
Why did you mistreat her like that?

25:01.960 --> 25:03.310
So you came for revenge.

25:04.550 --> 25:06.790
What does your mother's business
have to do with me?

25:06.790 --> 25:09.030
I was just following my master's orders.

25:09.030 --> 25:10.350
If you're that capable,

25:10.350 --> 25:12.160
go target those high and mighty masters!

25:12.160 --> 25:13.310
How did you know?

25:16.480 --> 25:18.070
That is my plan.

25:21.030 --> 25:22.720
Justice has a long arm.

25:23.750 --> 25:25.640
The evil you committed back then

25:27.270 --> 25:28.510
has finally caught up with you.

25:28.510 --> 25:29.480
What long arm of justice?

25:29.480 --> 25:30.740
Give my bracelet back!

25:31.270 --> 25:34.200
I'm just a servant who climbed the ladder!

25:34.480 --> 25:35.400
Give it back!

25:35.400 --> 25:37.330
If you have the guts, go after them!

25:41.070 --> 25:42.070
Look at yourself.

25:42.880 --> 25:43.830
How pathetic.

25:44.790 --> 25:47.240
You spent your entire life
clawing your way up,

25:47.240 --> 25:48.270
only to become

25:48.920 --> 25:51.880
a mere dog
for a high official's concubine.

26:09.520 --> 26:13.110
[Danyue Pavilion]

26:17.240 --> 26:18.160
My Lady.

26:18.310 --> 26:19.750
The estate Mei Yinghua gave you

26:19.750 --> 26:21.080
is indeed problematic.

26:21.440 --> 26:22.160
They say

26:22.240 --> 26:24.440
the estate has been
using the tenants' money

26:24.440 --> 26:25.550
for usury for years,

26:25.550 --> 26:27.750
delaying the payments owed to tenants.

26:27.960 --> 26:30.030
Now the matter has blown up.

26:30.240 --> 26:32.200
I'm afraid it'll be hard to suppress.

26:32.200 --> 26:34.680
It might reach Old Madam soon.

26:35.030 --> 26:35.920
It's fine.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.200
One step at a time.

26:37.720 --> 26:39.000
I'm already studying

26:39.110 --> 26:40.480
the estate's ledger.

26:41.400 --> 26:42.680
Did you find any clues

26:42.680 --> 26:43.880
in the ledger?

26:44.640 --> 26:45.920
Since she had the nerve to hand it over,

26:45.920 --> 26:47.790
she must've scrubbed it clean.

26:47.920 --> 26:50.120
This ledger shows absolutely nothing.

26:50.550 --> 26:52.310
Only by going to the estate to crosscheck

26:52.310 --> 26:54.030
might I find some holes.

26:54.750 --> 26:56.830
To bring down Nanny Rong,

26:56.890 --> 26:58.420
you took on this hot potato.

26:58.590 --> 27:00.250
That's a massive price to pay.

27:00.350 --> 27:02.350
And look at your body full of wounds.

27:02.350 --> 27:04.950
What kind of heiress
chooses to live like this?

27:08.720 --> 27:09.510
Baoxian,

27:09.750 --> 27:10.790
it's all thanks to you

27:10.790 --> 27:12.640
for swiping that bracelet for me.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.460
Otherwise, I wouldn't have been able to

27:14.460 --> 27:16.590
take over this hot potato so smoothly.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.160
Granny.

27:45.070 --> 27:46.240
My baby!

27:46.680 --> 27:47.880
Come here.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.370
I missed you so much.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.270
Granny.

27:51.830 --> 27:52.960
I brought you a gift.

27:54.000 --> 27:57.070
Why do you always bring me gifts
when you come back?

27:57.160 --> 27:58.960
I don't care about those things.

27:58.960 --> 28:00.070
All I care about is

28:00.650 --> 28:02.720
you coming back early to be with me.

28:04.030 --> 28:04.790
Granny,

28:05.110 --> 28:06.400
now's not the time yet.

28:06.830 --> 28:07.880
But I promise you

28:08.070 --> 28:09.400
I'll be as quick as I can.

28:10.830 --> 28:11.830
As for that money,

28:12.240 --> 28:13.270
just look at it as

28:13.270 --> 28:14.870
holding onto it on my behalf.

28:15.110 --> 28:16.160
Alright!

28:18.440 --> 28:19.350
Just now, I smelled

28:19.350 --> 28:21.840
my favorite pear curd.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.440
You can't eat this.

28:24.440 --> 28:26.240
I saved it for a regular customer.

28:26.240 --> 28:27.240
If you want some,

28:27.240 --> 28:28.640
I'll make it fresh for you

28:28.640 --> 28:29.880
with extra honey.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.430
Granny,

28:32.550 --> 28:34.110
I've only been gone a few days,

28:34.110 --> 28:36.240
and you have a new regular I don't know?

28:36.810 --> 28:39.780
It's that Young Master Yan
from the capital.

28:39.960 --> 28:42.640
He's been coming
to support my business lately.

28:42.880 --> 28:44.480
He's very nice

28:44.480 --> 28:45.590
and has no airs.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.920
A couple of days ago, he even

28:47.920 --> 28:49.120
helped me move flour.

28:49.240 --> 28:51.770
He was worried
I'd fall and sprain something.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.310
Does he come often?

28:55.310 --> 28:56.030
When?

28:56.240 --> 28:57.240
Why didn't I know?

28:58.510 --> 29:00.010
It's quite a coincidence.

29:00.270 --> 29:02.350
You two always arrive one after another.

29:02.350 --> 29:04.480
You leave, and he shows up right after.

29:07.480 --> 29:09.030
What's wrong, Dear?

29:09.550 --> 29:11.200
Why the frown?

29:11.200 --> 29:13.680
Are you still misunderstanding him?

29:14.160 --> 29:16.000
He's really a nice person.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.400
Granny,

29:18.790 --> 29:20.590
the human heart is hard to gauge.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.840
Anyway, don't trust outsiders easily.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.110
Outsiders?

29:27.510 --> 29:29.040
Fourth Lady, your words are

29:29.110 --> 29:30.400
truly heartbreaking.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.240
Yan,

29:33.400 --> 29:34.860
you came at the right time.

29:35.070 --> 29:35.590
Look,

29:35.790 --> 29:37.440
the soup is ready.

29:38.000 --> 29:38.830
This time,

29:39.110 --> 29:41.550
it's perilla, ginger, and jujube soup.

29:41.720 --> 29:42.690
With your condition,

29:42.690 --> 29:43.960
you need to eat more things

29:43.960 --> 29:46.070
that warm the stomach and dispel cold.

29:46.070 --> 29:47.130
Thank you, Granny.

29:47.920 --> 29:48.920
It smells so good.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.640
I'll pour a bowl for you.

29:53.110 --> 29:54.710
Come out with me for a second.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.070
Lord Yan,

30:03.200 --> 30:04.310
I don't know why

30:04.510 --> 30:06.480
you're relentlessly pursuing me.

30:07.270 --> 30:08.200
I've already gotten

30:08.200 --> 30:09.640
the things you wanted for you.

30:09.640 --> 30:11.510
I've also done what you asked me to do.

30:11.510 --> 30:13.070
Why won't you let me go?

30:17.750 --> 30:19.440
Granny doesn't know a thing.

30:20.000 --> 30:21.750
All your schemes to get close to her
are useless.

30:21.750 --> 30:23.610
You won't get anything out of her.

30:25.830 --> 30:27.440
Have you never truly given anyone

30:27.440 --> 30:28.440
your heart?

30:29.310 --> 30:32.040
Is that why you question
the sincerity of others?

30:33.110 --> 30:35.590
I have no ulterior motives
towards Granny Chen.

30:35.590 --> 30:38.240
She just reminds me of
my loved ones who are gone,

30:38.240 --> 30:40.070
so I want to look out for her.

30:40.110 --> 30:41.000
That's all.

30:43.400 --> 30:44.510
I swear every word

30:45.000 --> 30:46.270
I said is true.

30:47.090 --> 30:53.930
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

30:49.030 --> 30:50.830
You'll say anything, won't you?

30:51.750 --> 30:52.880
What do you mean?

30:53.590 --> 30:54.920
I'm completely sincere.

30:53.960 --> 31:01.150
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

31:01.250 --> 31:04.770
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

31:04.000 --> 31:05.240
You two are...

31:04.800 --> 31:07.970
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

31:05.750 --> 31:06.550
Granny Chen,

31:06.960 --> 31:08.070
I forgot to tell you that

31:07.990 --> 31:15.130
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

31:08.440 --> 31:09.440
Yunya and I survived

31:09.440 --> 31:11.070
ordeals together in the Xie Residence.

31:11.070 --> 31:13.400
Now we've buried the hatchet.

31:13.640 --> 31:14.720
Ordeals?

31:15.150 --> 31:22.270
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

31:15.510 --> 31:16.270
Dear,

31:16.270 --> 31:17.440
did you suffer?

31:17.440 --> 31:18.680
No, I didn't suffer.

31:18.680 --> 31:20.280
Don't listen to his rubbish.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.230
Really, I didn't suffer.

31:22.290 --> 31:30.060
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

31:22.640 --> 31:23.160
Look,

31:23.400 --> 31:24.550
aren't I perfectly fine?

31:24.550 --> 31:25.830
Don't you lie to me!

31:26.550 --> 31:27.880
I know you have your difficulties,

31:27.880 --> 31:29.480
but the older generation...

31:30.080 --> 31:33.380
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

31:32.070 --> 31:33.830
I mean, you're so young.

31:33.410 --> 31:36.810
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

31:33.830 --> 31:35.280
Your happiness and comfort

31:35.280 --> 31:36.720
matter the most.

31:36.830 --> 31:44.100
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

31:36.920 --> 31:39.110
Don't take everything upon yourself.

31:41.030 --> 31:42.160
That's right, Yunya.

31:42.160 --> 31:44.160
Don't always push yourself so hard.

31:44.160 --> 31:50.980
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

31:49.830 --> 31:50.750
Yan.

31:51.000 --> 31:58.190
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

31:51.440 --> 31:53.880
Although I don't know who you really are,

31:54.270 --> 31:57.030
but since you have dealings with the Xies,

31:57.160 --> 31:58.750
you must be no ordinary person.

31:58.380 --> 32:02.170
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

31:59.030 --> 32:00.240
Please take good care

32:00.920 --> 32:02.350
of my little girl.

32:02.190 --> 32:05.530
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

32:03.400 --> 32:04.720
What are you saying?

32:04.720 --> 32:05.720
I don't need his care.

32:05.550 --> 32:12.360
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

32:06.160 --> 32:06.880
Let's go, Granny.

32:06.880 --> 32:08.080
Don't worry, Granny.

32:09.480 --> 32:11.610
I'll take good care of your dear Yunya.

32:12.390 --> 32:18.990
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

32:16.590 --> 32:17.480
Let's go.

32:18.240 --> 32:19.920
Slow down. Jeez.

32:21.460 --> 32:24.190
[Heng River Ferry Terminal]

32:21.720 --> 32:23.590
Pay up! Pay up!

32:23.590 --> 32:24.790
Listen to me, everyone!

32:24.630 --> 32:27.180
[Xie Estate]

32:24.790 --> 32:26.070
It's been hell for us!

32:26.270 --> 32:27.830
We've weathered storms all year,

32:27.830 --> 32:29.680
just relying on this little harvest

32:29.680 --> 32:30.750
to earn some pennies to survive!

32:30.750 --> 32:32.270
Yes!

32:32.270 --> 32:33.070
As for them,

32:33.590 --> 32:35.750
they claim natural disasters
affected the harvest,

32:35.750 --> 32:38.000
but secretly embezzled our money

32:35.920 --> 32:38.700
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

32:38.000 --> 32:39.070
for private usury!

32:39.070 --> 32:40.340
Is there no justice?

32:40.370 --> 32:42.070
There's no justice!

32:42.090 --> 32:43.970
There's no justice!

32:44.000 --> 32:46.160
Folks, we must make them pay up!

32:44.590 --> 32:47.330
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

32:46.310 --> 32:48.110
We can't let them treat us like fools!

32:48.110 --> 32:49.350
Yes!

32:49.350 --> 32:50.270
Let's smash this place!

32:50.270 --> 32:52.760
Smash it! Smash it!

32:51.360 --> 32:52.620
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

32:52.790 --> 32:54.030
Smash it! Smash it!

32:52.840 --> 32:54.820
[Tea]

32:54.030 --> 32:56.160
What a brilliant move, Your Lordship.

32:56.240 --> 32:58.640
Falsely claiming that
the estate manager's ledger was recovered

32:58.640 --> 33:00.880
and leaking news of the estate's deficit

33:00.880 --> 33:02.750
really added fuel to the fire
for Xie Estate.

33:02.750 --> 33:03.610
Your Lordship,

33:04.000 --> 33:06.070
right after you mentioned the ledger,

33:06.070 --> 33:08.310
Guo Baofeng went to
see Second Young Master.

33:08.310 --> 33:09.200
So the ledger

33:09.310 --> 33:11.310
must be hidden in the Xie Residence.

33:11.750 --> 33:12.880
That's right.

33:13.310 --> 33:14.840
The estate manager is dead,

33:15.200 --> 33:17.130
and the ledger is in Xie Residence.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.440
They can run, but they can't hide.

33:20.590 --> 33:22.720
Our best option is to wait for a chance

33:23.000 --> 33:24.460
to look around the estate.

33:25.070 --> 33:27.070
I really feel sorry for Fourth Lady.

33:27.110 --> 33:29.110
She got caught in the crossfire
for no reason.

33:29.110 --> 33:31.040
I'm afraid this violent spectacle

33:31.110 --> 33:32.510
will reduce her to tears.

33:32.880 --> 33:33.880
Not necessarily.

33:34.510 --> 33:35.310
After all,

33:35.830 --> 33:37.960
she is the lady I chose.

33:44.000 --> 33:45.130
Fourth Lady is here.

33:46.830 --> 33:47.760
She really came.

33:48.590 --> 33:50.600
Pay up! Pay up!

33:50.620 --> 33:53.290
Pay up! Pay up!

33:53.310 --> 33:55.510
Pay up! Pay up!

33:55.680 --> 33:57.340
My Lady, it's dangerous here.

33:57.480 --> 33:58.880
If it doesn't work out, let's just leave.

33:58.880 --> 33:59.960
Since we're here,

34:00.240 --> 34:01.300
we can't be afraid.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.270
Isn't that the manager?

34:03.270 --> 34:04.480
Let's go!

34:04.510 --> 34:05.750
Let's go!

34:06.640 --> 34:07.270
Let's go!

34:08.480 --> 34:10.170
Pay up! Pay up!

34:10.190 --> 34:12.969
Pay up! Pay up!

34:13.000 --> 34:15.480
Pay up! Pay up!

34:20.070 --> 34:20.840
Pay up!

34:20.960 --> 34:23.050
Pay up! Pay up!

34:23.070 --> 34:25.310
Pay up! Pay up!

34:25.340 --> 34:27.290
Pay up! Pay up!

34:27.310 --> 34:29.440
Pay up! Pay up!

34:29.469 --> 34:32.030
Pay up! Pay up!

34:32.050 --> 34:36.480
Pay up! Pay up!

34:36.480 --> 34:37.400
Everyone!

34:37.630 --> 34:38.400
Silence!

34:38.460 --> 34:39.330
Pay up!

34:39.360 --> 34:41.840
I'm Xie Qingyuan,
the Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.760
The elders have

34:42.760 --> 34:43.880
put me in charge

34:44.000 --> 34:45.030
of this estate.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.590
Whatever grievances you have,

34:46.590 --> 34:47.760
you can let me know.

34:48.030 --> 34:50.230
I'll do my best to

34:50.230 --> 34:51.360
solve your problems.

34:51.360 --> 34:52.190
Solve our problems?

34:52.190 --> 34:53.520
How will you solve them?

34:53.550 --> 34:54.840
You just want to repudiate the debt!

34:54.840 --> 34:55.760
They took our money,

34:55.760 --> 34:57.920
and now they've got a woman to talk to us!

34:57.920 --> 34:59.920
-Can you hear me out?
-What's there to hear?

34:59.920 --> 35:01.550
Xies are all the same; all scum!

35:01.550 --> 35:03.110
Let's take her to the authorities!

35:03.110 --> 35:03.710
Wait.

35:04.550 --> 35:05.190
Can you...

35:05.190 --> 35:06.280
Can you hear me out first?

35:06.280 --> 35:07.000
What are you doing?

35:07.000 --> 35:08.530
-Let go of My Lady!
-My Lord.

35:08.710 --> 35:09.550
Let go!

35:09.800 --> 35:11.360
Let me go!

35:12.190 --> 35:12.840
Move!

35:14.590 --> 35:16.960
Your Lordship, Fourth Lady is...

35:18.030 --> 35:18.830
That's right.

35:19.190 --> 35:20.360
I am a Xie.

35:20.880 --> 35:23.140
But I didn't grow up in the Xie household.

35:28.840 --> 35:29.900
Since I was little,

35:30.550 --> 35:32.010
I wandered outside alone.

35:32.920 --> 35:34.120
My mother died early,

35:34.960 --> 35:36.480
and I had no one to rely on.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.320
I used to

35:38.800 --> 35:40.710
perform on the streets

35:40.960 --> 35:41.890
and beg for food.

35:42.890 --> 35:43.930
Sometimes,

35:43.960 --> 35:45.220
for a bowl of porridge,

35:45.440 --> 35:47.640
I'd kowtow in front of a porridge stall.

35:47.670 --> 35:48.880
For a steamed bun,

35:49.800 --> 35:51.510
I'd beg over half of Liuzhou.

35:52.360 --> 35:55.230
I've seen countless
ugly faces of the rich.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.000
Your suffering today

35:58.030 --> 35:59.960
was my visceral pain yesterday.

36:01.670 --> 36:02.800
Believe it or not,

36:03.230 --> 36:04.280
I, Xie Qingyuan,

36:04.760 --> 36:06.280
sincerely want to

36:06.880 --> 36:08.320
solve the problems for you.

36:08.320 --> 36:10.670
-Why should I trust you?
-Yeah! Why should I trust you?

36:10.670 --> 36:11.670
Because I know

36:12.360 --> 36:14.840
that for every day this money is delayed,

36:15.440 --> 36:17.230
more people will go hungry.

36:17.760 --> 36:19.230
You can choose not to believe me,

36:19.230 --> 36:21.360
and I cannot represent the Xie family.

36:21.510 --> 36:24.280
But I, Xie Qingyuan, guarantee with my

36:24.510 --> 36:26.040
reputation and conscience

36:26.400 --> 36:29.200
that if the Xie family
doesn't pay back this money,

36:29.550 --> 36:30.510
I, Xie Qingyuan,

36:30.670 --> 36:32.270
will compensate you in full!

36:42.000 --> 36:42.630
My Lady!

36:43.000 --> 36:43.860
Your Lordship.

36:46.000 --> 36:47.060
Bring me your IOUs.

36:59.710 --> 37:00.400
And mine.

37:01.480 --> 37:02.810
-This is mine.
-Here's mine.

37:02.810 --> 37:03.610
This is my IOU.

37:05.200 --> 37:06.260
-Fingerprint mine first!
-Mine!

37:06.260 --> 37:07.180
Excuse me.

37:07.200 --> 37:07.780
Mine! Mine!

37:07.780 --> 37:08.360
Don't push.

37:08.360 --> 37:09.020
Don't push.

37:10.280 --> 37:11.150
Is this real?

37:11.150 --> 37:12.280
My blood

37:12.960 --> 37:13.840
is my seal.

37:14.960 --> 37:15.920
Within 7 days,

37:16.110 --> 37:18.170
with the IOU bearing my fingerprint,

37:18.230 --> 37:20.030
you can ask the estate for money.

37:20.230 --> 37:22.800
If the estate really owes you money,

37:23.400 --> 37:24.930
it'll be repaid threefold,

37:25.030 --> 37:26.360
and your rent will be halved!

37:26.360 --> 37:29.000
Bravo!

37:29.030 --> 37:31.070
Bravo!

37:31.100 --> 37:35.000
Bravo!

37:35.760 --> 37:37.800
She actually managed to put out

37:38.110 --> 37:39.550
the fire I started.

37:45.520 --> 37:50.400
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

37:46.920 --> 37:49.980
As I thought, such a situation
doesn't faze you at alll.

37:50.760 --> 37:52.960
Lord Yan, you sure are in high spirits.

37:53.670 --> 37:55.480
When I was in grave danger just now,

37:55.480 --> 37:58.280
you just hid in the back
watching the drama unfold.

37:59.150 --> 38:00.800
You have a sharp mind.

38:00.880 --> 38:02.320
If I intervened rashly,

38:02.760 --> 38:04.550
wouldn't it ruin the good show?

38:07.190 --> 38:08.070
However...

38:11.320 --> 38:13.880
if you fail to keep your promise,

38:16.000 --> 38:18.800
the tenants' backlash
will be beyond disastrous.

38:25.230 --> 38:27.800
How do you know I can't keep my promise?

38:29.670 --> 38:31.130
Then how will you solve it?

38:33.710 --> 38:34.640
Are you curious?

38:38.190 --> 38:40.880
Lord Yan, since you love
watching the drama

38:41.110 --> 38:43.590
and care so much about Xie Estate,

38:44.000 --> 38:46.070
I must take you to see it for yourself.

38:46.320 --> 38:47.650
If I tell you in advance,

38:47.920 --> 38:49.520
it'll ruin the fun, won't it?

38:55.210 --> 38:59.900
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

39:47.960 --> 39:49.150
Oh, Lord Yan. Stop.

39:49.320 --> 39:50.230
My darling,

39:51.030 --> 39:53.230
how's the task I assigned coming along?

39:53.590 --> 39:56.630
It's been completed, of course.

39:58.110 --> 40:00.230
It's worth everything I've done

40:00.480 --> 40:01.960
to get you the estate.

40:02.960 --> 40:06.110
You have incredible foresight, My Lord.

40:06.110 --> 40:07.880
Second Madam is indeed

40:08.150 --> 40:09.800
behind the private usury.

40:10.480 --> 40:12.920
But the account is in a deficit now.

40:13.400 --> 40:15.800
That's why the tenants
were making a scene.

40:15.880 --> 40:17.920
Years of managing the household have made

40:17.920 --> 40:19.280
Concubine Mei very resourceful.

40:19.280 --> 40:20.840
Even if we get evidence,

40:21.110 --> 40:22.370
she'll never admit it.

40:22.630 --> 40:24.890
She'll just have someone take the blame.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.230
That's of course.

40:27.630 --> 40:30.800
Second Madam is behind the scenes.

40:31.280 --> 40:32.960
Nanny Rong is the one

40:33.480 --> 40:35.550
who actually handles everything.

40:37.480 --> 40:38.400
When Nanny Rong

40:38.400 --> 40:39.630
is arrested...

40:42.480 --> 40:43.440
Did I hear something?

40:43.440 --> 40:45.670
Maybe it's a stray cat.

40:51.550 --> 40:53.440
You sure know how to joke.

41:01.150 --> 41:02.440
When Nanny Rong

41:02.440 --> 41:04.590
is arrested and executed,

41:04.880 --> 41:06.280
the truth will be buried.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.230
By then,

41:08.800 --> 41:10.320
Concubine Mei's name will be cleared.

41:10.320 --> 41:12.380
You'll also have unearthed the truth

41:12.590 --> 41:14.120
and can answer to Old Madam.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.190
Yes.

41:16.840 --> 41:19.360
She's just a mere nanny.

41:20.000 --> 41:21.480
Who will care if she dies?

41:21.920 --> 41:24.360
So Second Madam put Nanny Rong in charge

41:24.840 --> 41:27.190
just to leave herself a way out.

41:31.150 --> 41:32.880
Then you should get ready

41:32.880 --> 41:34.710
to report to Old Madam tomorrow.

41:34.710 --> 41:35.710
MkvDrama.net
